:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frites\" title=\"Frites\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/FOOD_Potato_Wedges_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Frites\" title=\"Frites\">Frites</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haggis\" title=\"Haggis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/FOOD_Haggis_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Haggis\" title=\"Haggis\">Haggis</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><